  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1332\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1332</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1332\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=1332\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1332\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1332\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>이 실험을 보고 수업시간에 활용해보려고 했는데</p><p>생각해보니까 교과서에는 &quot;압력이 증가하면 부피가 감소한다&quot;라는 개념만을 다루고 있는데</p><p>저 실험은 부피가 감소하면 압력이 증가한다(그래서 물을 밀어올린다)는 것을 보여주는 실험 같아서 마음에 걸리네요</p><p>어떻게 생각하시나요?</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
